{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Feature Rich and Lightweight Headless utility, which means out of the box, it doesn't render or supply any actual UI elements. Some of its features include:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"100% Typesafe"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lightweight (10kb)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Easy to maintain"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extensible"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Not dictating UI"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"let-s-go","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Let's go!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enough overview, there's so much more to do with TanStack Ranger. Hit that next button and let's get started!"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"let-s-go","text":"Let's go!","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nFeature Rich and Lightweight Headless utility, which means out of the box, it doesn't render or supply any actual UI elements. Some of its features include:\n\n- 100% Typesafe\n- Lightweight (10kb)\n- Easy to maintain\n- Extensible\n- Not dictating UI\n\n## Let's go!\n\nEnough overview, there's so much more to do with TanStack Ranger. Hit that next button and let's get started!\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Overview\n---\n\nFeature Rich and Lightweight Headless utility, which means out of the box, it doesn't render or supply any actual UI elements. Some of its features include:\n\n- 100% Typesafe\n- Lightweight (10kb)\n- Easy to maintain\n- Extensible\n- Not dictating UI\n\n## Let's go!\n\nEnough overview, there's so much more to do with TanStack Ranger. Hit that next button and let's get started!\n"}
